OL,3,GNEWSA'I thought the word hospice meant
OL,4,Ait was the end for me'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAll his life, Steve Hyde has been fit
OL,7,Fand active and has dedicated his time
OL,8,Fto raising more than half a million
OL,9,Fpounds for charity.
OL,11,FBut two years ago, the 68-year-old
OL,12,Fformer paratrooper from Hartshill in
OL,13,FNuneaton, was diagnosed with motor
OL,14,Fneurone disease (MND). He said it was
OL,15,Fthe "lowest" he had ever felt and
OL,16,Fadmitted that, the first time he saw
OL,17,Fthe word 'hospice', he thought it was
OL,18,Fthe end for him.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,354,350,200,160,0,100
