OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F353A1790141193
OL,1,W5j 5Q7+ js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(W)
OL,3,GNEWSA'I thought the word hospice meant
OL,4,Ait was the end for me'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"It's like being hit with a bomb. You
OL,7,Fjust don't know where you are, what to
OL,8,Fdo, you're just totally lost. It's
OL,9,Ftotally destroying."
OL,11,FShortly after his diagnosis, he said he
OL,12,Fconsidered attempting to take his own
OL,13,Flife and walked to a bridge, but
OL,14,Fstopped when he thought about what
OL,15,Fwould happen to his dog.
